                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ef0add2f-7f5a-403f-8756-ec668e27a57e",
                                "sense_id": "d6ddc3c2-66e0-3575-b9b2-b7b8fbcaf1b8",
                                "text": "That gives them an advantage over their better-known peers, the Invisible Scratch Pickles: on the recent single \"Invisbl Skratch Piklz vs. da Klamz uv Deth\" the San Franciscans can spin heads with their superathletic scratching, but the side-length cut doesn't hold up as a piece of music."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "63f7ab6f-d412-4d69-8d6d-5fbdce5cf54c",
                                "sense_id": "d6ddc3c2-66e0-3575-b9b2-b7b8fbcaf1b8",
                                "text": "On the scale of linguistic complexity, basic leet is about on a par with pig Latin, and with five minutes' practice just about anyone can crank out elegant prose such as: y c@N' p30p13 R3kO9nIZ3 eh 834UTy uv 1337???"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
